--- !u!1001 &3173472239022993762
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 8702362140155849534}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'DOOM (1993) is not full 3D!

        You couldn''t look up or down,
        and level geometry couldn''t overlap. Moving entities such as enemies and
        pickups are flat 2D sprites made to face the player at all times. In order
        to make this, a unique sprite had to be made for each frame of animation
        of each enemy, and from 8 different directions!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
